# W1-A3 keeps everything.
#
# W1-A2 ignored grader output and per-run agent artifacts as "regenerable". They
# were not: when B2 had to be reconstructed, the only surviving traces were file
# mtimes and a truncated prompt, and RESULTS.md had already been overwritten by a
# later prep check. Nothing under w1a3/ is ignored.
#
# Tracked as evidence, exactly as the harness and grader left them:
#   runs/C*/work_definition.json   the agent artifact, where one was produced
#   runs/C*/acp_transcript.jsonl   append-only ACP transcript, in and out
#   runs/C*/harness_result.json    outcome, reason, controlled-input hashes
#   RESULTS.md / RESULTS.json      the grader's record
